## 6. Document Editing with Notepad

Double-clicking any non-notebook text file in the Project Explorer opens it in the built-in **Notepad**:
- Full syntax highlighting for Markdown (`.md`), Java (`.java`), Python (`.py`), SQL (`.sql`), Scala (`.sc`), Kotlin (`.kt`), Shell (`.sh`), JSON, YAML, and CSV.
- Integrated spell checker with English dictionary.
- Code folding, occurrence marking, and fast Find & Replace (`Ctrl+F` / `Ctrl+H`).

